to 8e64475 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7431\\n\\n* chore(deps): update ossf/scorecard-action action to v2.4.3 by @renovate[bot] in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7435\\n\\n* Allow optimizing locking for built-in exemplar reservoirs  by @dashpole in https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-go/pull/7423\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"add concurr safe test for metric aggreg by dashpol in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7379 chore dep updat github codeql action action to v3 305 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7425 sdk trace intern x generat x packag from x compon templat 7385 by ternua8 in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7411 chore dep updat modul go augendr info fatcontext to v0 90 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7426 generat grpc client target pars func by mralia in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7424 chore dep updat modul github com mattn go runewidth to v0 0 19 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7428 prometheus export chang default translat strategi by dashpol in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7421 onli enforc cardin limit when the attribut set doe not alreadi exist by dashpol in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7422 fix dep updat googleapi to 57b25ae by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7429 chore dep updat modul github com charmbracelet x ansi to v0 10 2 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7432 chore dep updat golang org x telemetri digest to 8e64475 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7431 chore dep updat ossf scorecard action action to v2 43 by renov bot in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7435 allow optim lock for built in exemplar reservoir by dashpol in http github com open telemetri opentelemetri go pull 7423\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"doc_type_kwd\": \"text\", \"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"document_keyword\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"id\": \"3d17045ae4a36b55\", \"image_id\": \"\", \"important_keywords\": [], \"mom_id\": \"\", \"positions\": [], \"row_id\": null, \"similarity\": 0.33810096295443054, \"tag_kwd\": [], \"term_similarity\": 0.11307570422061512, \"vector_similarity\": 0.8631599, \"dataset_name\": \"C2Raw-2\", \"document_name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"document_metadata\": {\"document_id\": \"8765f6c08a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"name\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"location\": \"opentelemetry/releases/release-v1.39.0.md\", \"type\": \"doc\", \"size\": 52878, \"chunk_count\": 30, \"create_date\": \"2026-07-28T23:53:51\", \"update_date\": \"2026-07-31T20:09:56\", \"token_count\": 15994, \"thumbnail\": \"\", \"dataset_id\": \"74f29ea88a9c11f197db2303d7337e37\", \"meta_fields\": {\"path\": \"sources\"}}}, {\"content\": \"- Improve performance of histogram `Record` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric` when min and max are disabled using `NoMinMax`. (#7306)\\n\\n- Improve error handling for dropped data during translation by using `prometheus.NewInvalidMetric` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/exporters/prometheus`. ⚠️ **Breaking Change:** Previously, these cases were only logged and scrapes succeeded. Now, when translation would drop data (e.g., invalid label/value), the exporter emits a `NewInvalidMetric`, and Prometheus scrapes **fail with HTTP 500** by default. To preserve the prior behavior (scrapes succeed while errors are logged), configure your Prometheus HTTP handler with: `promhttp.HandlerOpts{ ErrorHandling: promhttp.ContinueOnError }`. (#7363)\\n\\n- Replace fnv hash with xxhash in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute` for better performance. (#7371)\\n\\n- The default `TranslationStrategy` in `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/prometheus` is changed from `otlptranslator.NoUTF8EscapingWithSuffixes` to `otlptranslator.UnderscoreEscapingWithSuffixes`. (#7421)\\n\\n- Improve performance of concurrent measurements in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/sdk/metric`. (#7427)\\n\\n- Include W3C TraceFlags (bits 0–7) in the OTLP `Span.Flags` field in `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracehttp` and `go.opentelemetry.io/exporters/otlp/otlptrace/otlptracegrpc`. (#7438)\\n\\n- The `ErrorType` function in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/semconv/v1.37.0` now handles custom error types.\\n\\n  If an error implements an `ErrorType() string` method, the return value of that method will be used as the error type. (#7442)\\n\\n### Fixed\\n\\n- Fix `WithInstrumentationAttributes` options in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/trace`, `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/metric`, and `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/log` to properly merge attributes when passed multiple times instead of replacing them. Attributes with duplicate keys will use the last value passed. (#7300)\\n\\n- The equality of `attribute.Set` when using the `Equal` method is not affected by the user overriding the empty set pointed to by `attribute.EmptySet` in `go.opentelemetry.io/otel/attribute`. (#7357)\\n\", \"content_ltks\": \"improv perform of histogram record in go opentelemetri io otel sdk metric when min and max are disabl use nominmax 7306 improv error handl for drop data dure translat by use prometheus newinvalidmetr in go opentelemetri io otel export prometheus break chang previous these case were onli log and scrape succeed now when translat would drop data e g invalid label valu the export emit a newinvalidmetr and prometheus scrape fail with http 500 by default to preserv the prior behavior scrape succeed while error are log configur your prometheus http handler with promhttp handleropt errorhandl promhttp continueonerror 7363 replac fnv hash with xxhash in go opentelemetri io otel attribut for better perfo